    "Leave this field empty": "Iwanang walang laman",
    "Send Your Message": "Ipadala ang Mensahe",
    "We respect your privacy. Inquiries are transmitted securely and kept strictly confidential. Please do not include Social Security numbers, financial account details, or medical records.": "Iginagalang namin ang inyong privacy. Ligtas at kumpidensyal ang pagpapadala ng mga mensahe. Mangyaring huwag maglagay ng Social Security number, detalye ng bangko, o medikal na rekord.",
    "Website Information": "Impormasyon ng Website",
    "Terms of Use": "Mga Tuntunin sa Paggamit",
    "1. Using This Website": "1. Paggamit ng Website na Ito",
    "This website shares general information about Love RCFE’s advisory and consulting services. You may use it to learn about our services, utilize interactive planning calculators, and submit enquiries. Please provide accurate contact information and do not use the form to transmit unlawful, abusive, or copyrighted materials.": "Nagbabahagi ang website na ito ng pangkalahatang impormasyon tungkol sa mga serbisyo ng Love RCFE. Maaari ninyo itong gamitin upang matuto, gumamit ng kalkulador, at magtanong. Magbigay ng tamang impormasyon at huwag magpadala ng labag sa batas o nakakasakit na nilalaman.",
    "2. Advisory Guidance, Not Medical or Legal Guarantee": "2. Gabay Lamang, Hindi Medikal o Legal na Garantiya",
    "Information on this website is for general educational and placement assistance purposes only. It does not replace formal counsel from licensed attorneys, medical physicians, or state licensing regulators. Submitting an enquiry does not establish an attorney-client or fiduciary consulting relationship, nor does it guarantee specific placement availability or state license approval from the California Department of Social Services (CDSS).": "Ang impormasyon sa site na ito ay para sa pangkalahatang gabay lamang at hindi pumapalit sa payo ng lisensyadong abogado, doktor, o regulator ng estado. Ang pagpapadala ng mensahe ay hindi bumubuo ng opisyal na relasyong legal o garantiya ng pagkakapasa ng lisensya sa CDSS.",
    "3. Interactive Tools and Estimations": "3. Mga Interaktibong Tool at Pagtatantya",
    "Cost calculators and level-of-care assessment tools are provided for ballpark estimation only. Actual monthly facility charges are determined exclusively by the individual residential care home following their formal Physician's Assessment (LIC 602A) and pre-admission appraisal.": "Ang mga kalkulador ng gastos at pagsusuri ay gabay na tantya lamang. Ang aktwal na buwanang singil ay itinatakda lamang ng bawat care home matapos ang pormal na Physician's Assessment (LIC 602A).",
    "4. Changes & Contact": "4. Mga Pagbabago at Pakikipag-ugnayan",
    "These terms may be updated periodically to reflect changes in regulatory standards or service offerings. For questions, please reach out via our contact page.": "Maaaring i-update ang mga tuntuning ito paminsan-minsan upang umayon sa mga bagong regulasyon o serbisyo. Para sa mga katanungan, makipag-ugnayan sa aming contact page.",
    "Have a Question? Contact Us": "May tanong? Makipag-ugnayan",
    "Your Information": "Ang Inyong Impormasyon",
    "Privacy Policy": "Patakaran sa Privacy",
    "1. Information We Collect": "1. Impormasyong Kinokolekta Namin",
    "When you submit an enquiry through our contact forms or assessment tools, we collect the details you voluntarily submit: your name, email address, phone number, geographic region, inquiry category, message details, and submission timestamp. We do not sell your personal contact information to third-party marketing brokers.": "Kapag nagsumite kayo ng mensahe sa aming form o assessment tool, kinokolekta namin ang kusang-loob ninyong ibinigay: pangalan, email, telepono, rehiyon, paksa, mensahe, at oras ng pagsusumite. Hindi namin ibinebenta ang inyong impormasyon kaninuman.",
    "2. How Your Information is Used": "2. Paano Ginagamit ang Inyong Impormasyon",
    "The information you provide is utilized exclusively by our advisory team to respond to your request, assess appropriate senior living placement options, or provide consulting proposals for RCFE licensing. We may coordinate directly with licensed care homes you specifically authorize us to contact on your behalf.": "Ang ibinigay ninyong impormasyon ay ginagamit lamang ng aming grupo upang sagutin ang inyong hiling, suriin ang mga opsyon sa pag-aalaga, o magbigay ng panukala sa lisensyang RCFE kapag pinahintulutan ninyo.",
    "3. Medical Information Notice": "3. Paunawa Tungkol sa Impormasyong Medikal",
    "Please do not submit full Social Security numbers, detailed medical histories, or protected health information (PHI) via open public web forms. Sensitive medical appraisals (such as California Form LIC 602A) are shared only through secure, HIPAA-compliant channels during formal admission reviews.": "Huwag magsumite ng Social Security number, detalyadong kasaysayang medikal, o protektadong impormasyong pangkalusugan (PHI) sa bukas na web form. Ang mga sensitibong ulat tulad ng LIC 602A ay ibinabahagi lamang sa ligtas at HIPAA-compliant na paraan.",
    "4. Data Access & Removal Requests": "4. Pag-access at Pagtanggal ng Datos",
    "5. Services We Use": "5. Mga Serbisyong Ginagamit Namin",
    "To run this site we rely on a few third-party services: Cloudflare (website hosting, database storage, spam protection, and privacy-friendly traffic statistics), Formspree (to email us the messages you submit), and ipify / icanhazip (to look up your device's second internet address when you use our forms). Information you submit through our forms may pass through these services so that we can receive and respond to it.": "Upang patakbuhin ang site na ito, gumagamit kami ng Cloudflare (hosting, database, proteksyon sa spam, at pribadong estadistika), Formspree (upang maipadala sa aming email ang inyong mensahe) at ipify / icanhazip (upang malaman ang ikalawang internet address ng inyong device kapag ginamit ninyo ang aming mga form).",
    "Contact Our Privacy Officer": "Makipag-ugnayan sa Privacy Officer",
    "Call Love RCFE": "Tumawag sa Love RCFE",
