    "The security check could not load. Please turn off ad blockers for this site, or call (818) 217-5755 or email loveRCFE@gmail.com.": "Hindi mai-load ang security check. Mangyaring patayin ang ad blocker para sa site na ito, o tumawag sa (818) 217-5755 o mag-email sa loveRCFE@gmail.com.",
    "For your privacy, please do not include Social Security numbers in web messages.": "Para sa inyong privacy, huwag isama ang Social Security number sa mga mensahe sa web.",
    "Please check the highlighted fields.": "Pakisuri ang mga nakasaad na field.",
    "Please enter or calculate a valid budget amount on the calculator first.": "Mangyaring maglagay o magkalkula muna ng wastong halaga ng badyet sa kalkulador.",
    "Specialized Memory Care Community or Secured RCFE": "Espesyal na Memory Care Community o Secured RCFE",
    "Given memory impairment and potential wandering risks, your loved one requires a state-licensed facility with certified delayed egress security, dementia-trained 24/7 care staff, and predictable sensory routines.": "Dahil sa paghina ng memorya at panganib ng paglalagalag, kailangan ng pasilidad na may delayed egress security, kawaning sinanay sa demensya 24/7, at tahimik na iskedyul.",
    "Does the home have an approved Dementia Plan of Operation on file with CDSS?": "May aprubadong Dementia Plan of Operation ba ang tahanan sa CDSS?",
    "Are perimeter pathways and exits secured with delayed egress and audible chimes?": "Ligtas ba ang mga daanan at labasan na may delayed egress at chime?",
    "What is the staff-to-resident ratio during the night shift?": "Ano ang ratio ng staff sa residente tuwing pang-gabi?",
    "How does staff redirect agitation or exit-seeking without chemical sedation?": "Paano pinapakalma ng kawani ang pagkabalisa nang walang pampakalmang gamot?",
    "High-Acuity Residential Board & Care with Hospice Waiver": "High-Acuity Residential Board & Care na may Hospice Waiver",
    "Because significant help with mobility, turning, or transfers is necessary, an intimate 6-bed residential home provides the essential 1-on-3 caregiver ratio required to prevent falls, skin breakdown, and hospital readmissions.": "Dahil malaking tulong sa paggalaw, pagbaling, at paglipat ang kailangan, ang 6-bed home ay nagbibigay ng mahalagang 1-sa-3 na ratio upang maiwasan ang pagkahulog at muling pagka-ospital.",
    "Does the facility have an active Bedridden Clearance and Hospice Waiver for the room?": "May aktibo bang Bedridden Clearance at Hospice Waiver para sa kwartong iyon?",
    "Can caregivers perform 2-person physical transfers or operate a hoyer lift safely?": "Ligtas bang nakakagawa ng 2-person transfer o nakakagamit ng hoyer lift ang mga caregiver?",
    "How frequently are non-ambulatory residents turned and repositioned?": "Gaano kadalas pinipihit o binabago ng posisyon ang mga residenteng nakaratay?",
    "Does the visiting home health or hospice nurse have direct 24/7 coordination with staff?": "May direktang 24/7 na koordinasyon ba sa kawani ang bumibisitang nurse o hospice?",
    "Assisted Living Community / Independent Living": "Komunidad ng Assisted Living / Independent Living",
    "Your loved one remains largely independent but will thrive with nutritious meal service, vibrant social activities, housekeeping, and medication cueing to maintain dignity and prevent loneliness.": "Malaki pa ang kakayahang mag-isa ng inyong mahal sa buhay, ngunit mas magiging masigla siya sa masustansyang pagkain, aktibidad, paglilinis, at paalala sa gamot upang maiwasan ang pag-iisa.",
    "What social activities, gardening, and creative programs take place daily?": "Anong mga aktibidad na panlipunan, paghahalaman, at malikhaing programa ang ginagawa araw-araw?",
    "Are transportation services provided for doctor appointments and shopping?": "May serbisyong transportasyon ba para sa appointment sa doktor at pamimili?",
    "How are changes in health or subtle cognitive changes reported to family?": "Paano ipinapaalam sa pamilya ang pagbabago sa kalusugan o memorya?",
    "Are medications managed and logged by trained caregivers under strict physician orders?": "Pinamamahalaan at itinatala ba ng sinanay na caregiver ang mga gamot ayon sa utos ng doktor?",
    "Is night staff awake or on-call sleep? (Awake staff is strongly recommended).": "Gising ba ang staff sa gabi o natutulog na on-call? (Mas inirerekomenda ang gising na staff).",
    "Can residents bring their own familiar bedroom furniture?": "Maaari bang magdala ang residente ng sariling pamilyar na muwebles sa kwarto?",
    "What is the monthly rate stability policy when care needs increase?": "Ano ang patakaran sa presyo kapag nadagdagan ang pangangailangan sa pag-aalaga?",
    "Please fill out all required fields.": "Pakipunan ang lahat ng kinakailangang field.",
    "We make calls Monday through Saturday. Please pick another date.": "Lunes hanggang Sabado lang kami tumatawag. Pumili ng ibang petsa.",
    "Sending your call request…": "Ipinapadala ang inyong hiling na tawag…",
    "✓ Request received. An advisor will call you on {date} ({time}) to confirm.": "✓ Natanggap ang kahilingan. Tatawagan kayo ng tagapayo sa {date} ({time}) upang kumpirmahin.",
    "Sending your confidential enquiry…": "Ipinapadala ang inyong kumpidensyal na mensahe…",
    "✓ Thank you, {name}. Your message was sent. An elder care advisor will reply within 1 business day.": "✓ Salamat, {name}. Naipadala na ang inyong mensahe. Sasagot ang aming tagapayo sa loob ng 1 araw ng trabaho.",
    "If your email app didn't open automatically, ": "Kung hindi kusang bumukas ang inyong email app, ",
    "click here to send by email": "i-click ito upang ipadala sa email",
